{"id":"ae8f51f4a773338a","group":"27","path":"27/27-ex-pblocalgap.md","title":"二次函数中局部峰与全局峰的任意大差距","display":"ex-pblocalgap — 二次函数中局部峰与全局峰的任意大差距","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-ex-pblocalgap","aliases":["27-ex-pblocalgap"],"display":"ex-pblocalgap — 二次函数中局部峰与全局峰的任意大差距","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbunimodality]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.1 and Exercise 13.5","source_printed_pages":"587, 607","source_pdf_pages":"611, 631","verification_status":"source-topic-checked-local-example"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-ex-pblocalgap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-ex-pblocalgap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-pblocalgap — 二次函数中局部峰与全局峰的任意大差距"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a80118b233c9c7df\" href=\"?note=a80118b233c9c7df\" title=\"27-df-pbunimodality\">27-df-pbunimodality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.1 and Exercise 13.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"587, 607"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"611, 631"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-topic-checked-local-example"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(M\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_M:\\{0,1\\}^2\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f_M:\\{0,1\\}^2\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,\\mathrm{LM}\">\\(d,\\mathrm{LM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a80118b233c9c7df\" href=\"?note=a80118b233c9c7df\" title=\"27-df-pbunimodality\">27-df-pbunimodality</a> 中的集合构造，不要求单射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_M(x_1,x_2)\\coloneqq-x_1-x_2+(M+2)x_1x_2\\quad((x_1,x_2)\\in\\{0,1\\}^2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_M(x_1,x_2)\\coloneqq-x_1-x_2+(M+2)x_1x_2\\quad((x_1,x_2)\\in\\{0,1\\}^2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LM}(f_M,\\{0,1\\}^2)=\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\},\\qquad\nf_M(0,0)=0,\\qquad f_M(1,1)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^2}f_M(x)=M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LM}(f_M,\\{0,1\\}^2)=\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\},\\qquad\nf_M(0,0)=0,\\qquad f_M(1,1)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^2}f_M(x)=M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>四点值依次为0、−1、−1、M。00与11都严格优于各自邻居，所以为局部峰，而只有11全局最优。差距M任意大；这是书中一般警告的显式见证，非声称书中逐字给出此表达式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbunimodality","status":"resolved","id":"a80118b233c9c7df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbunimodality]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbunimodality","status":"resolved","id":"a80118b233c9c7df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$f_M:\\{0,1\\}^2\\to\\mathbb R$；$d,\\mathrm{LM}$ 为 [[27-df-pbunimodality]] 中的集合构造，不要求单射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"f_M:\\{0,1\\}^2\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"d,\\mathrm{LM}","display":false},{"tex":"f_M(x_1,x_2)\\coloneqq-x_1-x_2+(M+2)x_1x_2\\quad((x_1,x_2)\\in\\{0,1\\}^2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LM}(f_M,\\{0,1\\}^2)=\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\},\\qquad\nf_M(0,0)=0,\\qquad f_M(1,1)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^2}f_M(x)=M.","display":true}],"bytes":1303,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-ex-pblocalgap|ex-pblocalgap — 二次函数中局部峰与全局峰的任意大差距]]"}],"outgoing":["a80118b233c9c7df"]}